```yml
Fecha: [YYYY-MM-DD-HH-mm-ss]
Tipo: fix
Bug ID: [ID del bug, ej: BUG-456]
Severidad: [Critical/High/Medium/Low]
Reportado por: [Nombre]
Corregido por: [Nombre]
Archivos modificados: [N]
Tests añadidos: [SI/NO]
Verificado: [SI/NO]
```

fix(scope): short description of the bug fix

Explain the bug:
- What was broken
- What symptom did users see
- Root cause analysis

Explain the fix:
- What changed to fix the issue
- Why this fix works
- Any edge cases handled
- Testing performed

Before:
[code or behavior that was broken]

After:
[code or behavior that's now working]

Fixes:
- Issue: [description]
- Regression risk: [low/medium/high]
- Testing: [manual/automated/both]

Examples:
fix(auth): handle null user in token validation
fix(api): fix race condition in concurrent requests
fix(build): correct broken reference in sphinx config
fix(database): prevent null foreign key inserts

